00:01:45.415 --> 00:01:49.136
Abigail Silva: Welcome to
WordPress Accessibility Day 2026.

00:01:49.203 --> 00:01:53.701
My name is Abigail Silva, and I am
a digital accessibility consultant

00:01:53.986 --> 00:01:57.265
with the State of California
Department of Rehabilitation.

00:01:57.786 --> 00:02:01.566
Thank you for joining us for
Band-Aids on Broken Code: Why

00:02:01.577 --> 00:02:06.184
Accessibility Plugins Can't Replace
Human Skill with Julia Undeutsch.

00:02:06.643 --> 00:02:11.122
Julia is a dev and UX
accessibility specialist at Atos.

00:02:11.553 --> 00:02:16.187
After graduating from university with
degrees in musicology and Japanese

00:02:16.195 --> 00:02:20.879
studies in the summer of 2020, she
started learning front-end development and

00:02:20.879 --> 00:02:23.704
specialized in web accessibility early on.

00:02:24.096 --> 00:02:28.132
And since then, she has taken every
opportunity to spread awareness

00:02:28.158 --> 00:02:32.143
on the topic by regularly creating
content in the form of blog

00:02:32.166 --> 00:02:35.088
articles and similar materials.

00:02:36.177 --> 00:02:41.514
She was certified by IAAP as a
professional in accessibility core

00:02:41.518 --> 00:02:50.017
competencies in 2022 and as a web
accessibility specialist in 2025

00:02:50.041 --> 00:02:55.868
and was accepted into the Google
Developer Expert Program in 2023.

