That, you are just a wealth of
information there, and I know that you

00:37:27.652 --> 00:37:30.214
are very passionate about what you do.

00:37:30.215 --> 00:37:32.747
I can see it shine through in all you do.

00:37:33.069 --> 00:37:35.728
So thank you so much
for that presentation.

