"Hey, I'm that kind of a plugin that

00:39:39.784 --> 00:39:41.078
you can use this, and we're so good.

00:39:41.112 --> 00:39:44.369
We have this for people with
visual impairment." Yeah.

00:39:45.270 --> 00:39:47.000
And also no, no other recommendation.

00:39:47.002 --> 00:39:51.126
I think if you need something,
you are either used to screen

00:39:51.129 --> 00:39:55.246
magnifier or, yeah, use the zoom
in and out from the browser itself.

00:39:56.620 --> 00:39:57.613
